@api = http://localhost:5282

### 1. Créer une nouvelle partie (placement automatique aléatoire)
# @name createAutoGame
POST {{api}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
@gameId = {{createAutoGame.response.body.gameId}}

### 2. Créer une partie avec placement manuel complet de la flotte
POST {{api}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ships": [
    { "shipType": "Carrier", "row": 0, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Battleship", "row": 2, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Destroyer", "row": 4, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Submarine", "row": 6, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "TorpedoBoat", "row": 8, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" }
  ]
}

### 3. [Erreur attendue 400] Créer une partie avec configuration invalide (chevauchement)
POST {{api}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ships": [
    { "shipType": "Carrier", "row": 0, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Battleship", "row": 0, "col": 1, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Destroyer", "row": 4, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "Submarine", "row": 6, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" },
    { "shipType": "TorpedoBoat", "row": 8, "col": 0, "direction": "Horizontal" }
  ]
}

### 4. Obtenir l'état de la partie (secret adverse préservé)
GET {{api}}/games/{{gameId}}

### 5. [Erreur attendue 404] Obtenir une partie inexistante
GET {{api}}/games/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Tirer sur une case valide
POST {{api}}/games/{{gameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "row": 0,
  "col": 0
}

### 7. [Erreur attendue 400] Tirer hors limites de la grille (validation FluentValidation)
POST {{api}}/games/{{gameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "row": 15,
  "col": -2
}

### 8. Document de spécification OpenAPI (.NET 10)
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
